<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines' All Asia posts 25 pct net rise in '96.</title>
<headline>Philippines' All Asia posts 25 pct net rise in '96.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' All AsiaCapital and Trust Corp said on Monday it posted 25 percent net income growth last year to reach 225 million pesos.</p>
<p>All AsiaCapital said in a statement that gross revenues were 946 million pesos, compared to 636 million the previous year.</p>
<p>It attributed the rise in income to its strong participation in short-term and long-term commercial paper issuances as well as equity issues.</p>
<p>All AsiaCapital is one of the leading financial companies in the country.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
